<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $0.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $0.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were mostly $0.50 lower. Demand and movement were moderate. Top $60.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>				 Country		     Plant</p>
<p>US 1-2   230-260 LBS.  58.00-59.50 Few 60.00  59.00-60.50</p>
